# The generated corpus is tracked: the PDFs and their folder hierarchy are the
# apparatus the demo is argued on, and a reader who cannot see the tree cannot
# check the collisions it plants. It is regenerable (`just corpus`) and
# byte-identical for a seed, so it costs ~1 MB and no ambiguity. The *graph* is
# not tracked — that is a database, rebuilt with `just ingest corpus`.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/shots/
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
